! mcp_bootstrap_p358.strap -- MCP printed page 358: the $DUMP program's
! floating-point field formatter tail (exponent / fraction sign
! characters stored via $14, AUP loop, AZFRTN), then the $DUMP's
! working storage: ATEMPD, ABUFF, APCOL1, AMNMBF, the one-bit flags
! AHLFWD..ACTLBT, and the panel index words APNLW1-APNLW4, lines 1-50.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.108, read at 400 dpi, names and
! doubtful glyphs at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041
! PUNID 22$DUMP  CARD ID VB000742  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER
! 358"; the heading row's LOCATION field is 236007, line 1's word.
!
! >>> STILL THE $DUMP (PUNID 22$DUMP, card series VB...).  No new
! PUNID, no SLC on the page.  The LOADER (pp.320-334) is an overlay at
! overlapping addresses; nothing here is taken from it.  No TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  50 lines; every line number prints a "*".  "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 5, 17, 32, 34.  Remarks on lines 36 (-USE AS
! LOADER BUFFER) and 45 (-USED FOR COMPUTING $MR).  Located rows
! contiguous from 236007.00 (line 1) to 236153.00 (line 50, XW, a full
! word; next 236154.00).  Lines 43-44 are SYNs (print "+00000000
! BU,01 ,10", no counter move); lines 34-42, 45 DRZs print their
! reservation size, no !CHECK (printed p.317 convention); lines 39, 46
! DD(BU,1),0 print "0" left of NAME.
!
! JOIN.  p.357 (tools/page_sheet.py 357, not landed) ends with
! ST(BU,64),1.16($14) at 236006.00, a full word: next 236007.00 =
! line 1.  p.359 (sheet) opens at 236154.00 (APNLW5 XW): contiguous.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 1 "LF(DU,24,4)": the mode's first glyph has the straight
!     left stem and squared corners of the D in ATEMPD on the same
!     card (900 dpi); written DU as printed, not BU.
!   * line 3 "ACCTLC": written AOCTLC, the family of AOCTLB on line 2
!     (as decks/mcp_bootstrap_p345.strap).
!   * line 23 "ACMPND": the second glyph has a straight left stem like
!     the final D (900 dpi), and the landed stand-in ADMPND
!     (pp.342-344) is at the same 236162 word: written ADMPND.
!   * lines 22, 45 APNLI, line 25/39 AFLPTI, line 43 AFRACI, lines
!     40-41 ASPUBI/ASPLBI: final glyph is the letter I (serifs top and
!     bottom, no flag), unlike the digit 1 in APCOL1, AFLP1, APNLW1
!     on the same page (flag).  ASPUBI/ASPLBI as landed pp.342-344.
!   * line 36 APCOL1: C open, O closed, final digit 1 with flag; as
!     landed p.344's stand-in.
!   * line 46 ACTLBT: second glyph open, same as the C in AFRACI;
!     kept C (no closed glyph anywhere says O).
!   * octal/hex open rounds read 0 ("FO" = F0, "CO" = 00, ".CC" = .00).
!
! EXTERNALS.  None is defined by a landed deck (the $DUMP pages from
! p.346 on are not landed); values from this page's binary, or copied
! from the pp.342-345 $DUMP stand-ins.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  VB000742 .. VB000789.  Shared serials, each a SIC/B
! pair: lines 2-3 (743), 20-21 (760).  None skipped.

AOCTLB  SYN, (8)235376.40            ! not landed; SIC line 2 235376.40, BIT-EXACT
AOCTLC  SYN, (8)235373.40            ! not landed; B line 3 235373.50, half word only (printed "ACCTLC")
